\cf4 \cb3     <\cf6 div\cf4  style="\cf7 font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:bold;color:#1a2332;line-height:1.25;margin-bottom:6px;\cf4 ">NIH Has Distributed Only 15% of Its Research Budget &#8212; University Labs Are in Crisis</\cf6 div\cf4 >\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3     <\cf6 div\cf4  style="\cf7 font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:14px;font-style:italic;font-weight:300;color:#3a4a5c;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:14px;\cf4 ">AAMC data shows NIH has obligated only $5.8B of its $38B annual research budget at fiscal midpoint. A STAT News survey of nearly 1,000 researchers documents lab closures, career exits, and disproportionate harm to women and early-career scientists.</\cf6 div\cf4 >\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf5 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \cb3     <\cf6 div\cf4  style="\cf7 height:2px;background-color:#c9963a;width:50px;margin-bottom:18px;\cf4 "></\cf6 div\cf4 >\cb1 \
